    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "yalda askarpour",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111713985010252906287/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvmU0sDovhdH7TizJfKL79U2UtmlekhAgTCdTYRt3Aqqlj_p8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing experience with catou! She was incredibly professional, attentive, and made sure I was comfortable throughout the entire process. My lashes look stunning—natural yet voluminous, just how I wanted! I couldn’t be happier with the results and will definitely be coming back. Highly recommend her for anyone looking for top-notch lash services!",
        "time": 1727042260,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nina Ni",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103629892665511722888/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYpA8DPZmg1vqxwpJVFSiPtZ8A4BD_HH1TTycfZoA8axFOiA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Catou has been doing my lashes for the past 5 years and has been doing a wonderful job keeping them beautiful and healthy. She genuinely cares about the health of the lashes, letting you know if she sees any weakening, and provides helpful suggestions, which is really important to me. Her styling is also always on point! I highly recommend Catou!!",
        "time": 1685288058,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Melanie Reyes",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108703632689635450080/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7H3w_seTfCmam6omquBLQwABcqkm5q4_ZcFfCsR--V5tP1ds=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I met Catou at another salon about 5 years ago and when she started her own business, I literally followed her around town! She's gentle and attentive and takes the best care of my natural lashes. She's meticulous and has made miracles happen with my short, thin and sparse Asian lashes. She always prioritizes natural lash health and takes excellent care of me. Her salon is quiet, clean and tasteful. She's flexible and has been able to accommodate me when I've had to switch up appointments on her last minute. Would definitely recommend!",
        "time": 1681820523,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cathy Diemahave",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116608356703258526838/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-ZfEnjlyBNxuplE4xNQkiaXntzglmHEG0p84tBY8jhwfYxw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Catou has been doing my lashes now for about 8 years. Her main concern is your lash health which I really appreciate. She won’t simply do what you want and over bare your lashes with extensions that are too heavy or full for your lashes at the moment.  Catou taught me how to take care of my lashes and now we can safely do volume lashes which I love. She is professional and caring. Her work is outstanding honestly. I have seen and heard of many horrible stories and experiences that put people off extensions. I can honestly say my lashes are healthier now since I’ve had extensions with Catou than they were prior. I find they make me look younger, more awake and overall just more attractive, without the fuss and mess of mascara. Wonderful experience, beautiful lady, inside and out.",
        "time": 1669997791,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "E",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114610315625272245110/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYiomjevm9QU6jwUTMCP4WnGGCMVpXGO_OVTm78ZkE8PGDMw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I’ve been doing my lashes with Catou for a few months now and she always does an amazing job! She genuinely cares about the health of the natural lashes and the extensions still look good at 3 weeks when I go in for my fill. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1678110180,
        "translated": false
      }
